decisions:
- id: C2.DEC-027
  title: Capability granularity
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: A capability is one semantic operation surface × access pattern × query
    signature × produced observation-family set × response-semantic contract.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-001
  - C1.05R1
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-044
- id: C2.DEC-028
  title: Vendor-neutral access-pattern taxonomy
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Use DIRECT_LOOKUP/SEARCH/ENUMERATION/SNAPSHOT_FETCH/WINDOWED_SERIES_FETCH/EVENT_COLLECTION_FETCH/DOCUMENT_DISCOVERY/DOCUMENT_RETRIEVAL/BULK_EXPORT/STREAM_SUBSCRIPTION
    as provider-side access patterns.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-001
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-045
- id: C2.DEC-029
  title: Static semantic capability boundary
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Capability is not health, credentials, quota/cache, certification, routing
    priority, PIT, source fitness, or side-effect authority.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.00 boundary
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-046
- id: C2.DEC-030
  title: Mode-specific endpoint semantics
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Materially different request/response semantics require separate semantic
    records/capabilities.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-002
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-047
- id: C2.DEC-031
  title: Explicit provider-wide semantic adoption
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Provider-wide semantic defaults are never implicit; endpoint profiles
    explicitly pin adopted refs.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-002
  - C1.05R1 replay
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-048
- id: C2.DEC-032
  title: Field semantic record
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Field semantics explicitly capture provider selector, meaning, shape,
    unit/scale, null/missing/sentinel, enum, timestamp role and grouping.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-002
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-049
- id: C2.DEC-033
  title: C1-facing observation-family continuity
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: C2 supports the exact C1.05R1 provider observation categories as interface
    families.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C1.05R1 §5
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-050
- id: C2.DEC-034
  title: Additional provider observations remain non-canonical
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Additional C2 observation families remain provider-side and cannot mint
    C1 identity.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C1 identity firewall
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-051
- id: C2.DEC-035
  title: Explicit request semantic profile
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Endpoint request semantics pin query slots, requirement/optionality/exclusion
    and provider-native defaults.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-002
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-052
- id: C2.DEC-036
  title: Explicit response semantic profile
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Endpoint response semantics pin cardinality, grouping, fields, pagination
    and provider-native absence/partiality signals.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-002
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-053
- id: C2.DEC-037
  title: Absence signal does not equal data outcome
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Provider-native absence signals are descriptive only in C2.01; C2.02
    decides NO_DATA legality.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-005
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-054
- id: C2.DEC-038
  title: Partiality signal does not equal data outcome
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Provider-native truncation/partiality signals are descriptive only in
    C2.01; C2.02 decides PARTIAL legality.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-005
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-055
- id: C2.DEC-039
  title: Pagination does not equal completeness
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Endpoint pagination/collection semantics do not certify exhaustive coverage.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-010
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-056
- id: C2.DEC-040
  title: Stable semantic ref tuple
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: Load-bearing C2 semantic ref requires authority/kind/logical_id/semantic_revision/content_sha256.
  authority_scope: C2.01
  evidence_refs:
  - C2.OPEN-003
  - C1.05R1 §4.1
  required_acceptance_tests:
  - C2-057
- id: C2.DEC-041
  title: No load-bearing floating aliases
  status: CANDIDATE_ADOPTED_PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW
  statement: latest/current/mutable aliases cannot be persisted as load-bearing semantic
    refs.
  authority_scope: C2.01
